					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630803
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630803,
					"content": "唔，這上面有很濃厚的岩元素之力…這不是「翠玨岩」嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630804
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630804,
					"content": "「翠玨岩」…我記得白朮說過，說過，反正我原話記不住，總之就是說，會對人產生不好的影響。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630805
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630805,
					"content": "那不可能，這是我的朋友賣我的，我鐵打的兄弟，啊，還能害我嗎！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630806
					],
					"speakerTitle": "自稱「唐無仇」者"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630806,
					"content": "而且我那朋友還有很多玉石打製的首飾…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630807
					],
					"speakerTitle": "自稱「唐無仇」者"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630807,
					"content": "你的朋友？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630808
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630808,
					"content": "對啊，他叫老臭，一個做玉石生意的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630809,
						710630811
					],
					"speakerTitle": "自稱「唐無仇」者"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630809,
					"content": "他人在哪？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630810
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710630810,
					"content": "他就在層岩巨淵這附近，最近據說也還幫著賣玉石打造的首飾呢…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630813
					],
					"speakerTitle": "自稱「唐無仇」者"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630813,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，如果那個人還在賣用「翠玨岩」做的首飾之類的話，肯定會有很多人都受到影響的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630814
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630814,
					"content": "我們還是去看一下吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710630811,
					"content": "他還在賣首飾？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710630812
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710630812,
					"content": "我不知道他是不是還在賣，但是他就在層岩巨淵附近…",
