					"content": "好醜。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631106
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710631106,
					"content": "就是盜寶團之前那些人做出來的，根本賣不出去。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631107,
					"content": "不過好歹算是真材實料，把那上面的寶石摳下來也能值點錢…哎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631108,
					"content": "#{F#妳}{M#你}們就把這個送給老唐吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631109,
					"content": "那我們就先走了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631110,
					"content": "嘿，要是有空的話，再來我這玩挖寶啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710631111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "老臭"
				},
				{
					"id": 710631111,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}，我們現在就回去嗎？",
